{{!-- A2's head: no cover photo, the titling carries the page.

The rule under it is the head's own bottom border, so this block owns its whole vertical
extent and the grid below starts clean. The two-column strip is the standfirst beside a
description list of the two marginals the design shows — who wrote it and how long it runs —
and it re-flows to one column on its own, from `auto-fit`, without a breakpoint.

`{{reading_time}}` is computed by Ghost from word count and image count on every render and
is stored nowhere, so "12 min read" is whatever the body implies, never a field. --}}
<div class="border-border border-b">
	<div class="container pt-20 pb-14">
		<p class="font-meta text-meta text-accent tracking-[0.16em] uppercase">
			{{#primary_tag}}<a
					href="{{url}}"
					class="text-accent no-underline">{{name}}</a><span aria-hidden="true"> · </span>{{/primary_tag}}{{date format="DD MMM YYYY"}}
		</p>

		<h1
			class="font-display tracking-display mt-[26px] max-w-[24ch] text-[clamp(38px,6vw,76px)] leading-[1.02] font-medium text-balance">{{title}}</h1>

		<div class="border-border mt-9 grid grid-cols-[repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(260px,100%),1fr))] gap-8 border-t pt-7">
			{{#if custom_excerpt}}
				<p class="font-body text-muted max-w-[46ch] text-[21px] leading-[1.5] text-pretty">{{custom_excerpt}}</p>
			{{/if}}

			<dl class="flex flex-wrap gap-10 self-start">
				{{#if authors}}
					<div>
						<dt class="text-muted font-mono text-[10.5px] tracking-[0.1em] uppercase">{{t "Written by"}}</dt>
						<dd class="font-ui mt-2 ml-0 text-[15px] font-semibold">
							{{> "byline-links" linkClass="text-text no-underline"}}
						</dd>
					</div>
				{{/if}}

				<div>
					<dt class="text-muted font-mono text-[10.5px] tracking-[0.1em] uppercase">{{t "Length"}}</dt>
					<dd class="font-ui mt-2 ml-0 text-[15px] font-semibold">{{reading_time seconds=(t "< 1 min read") minute=(t "1 min read") minutes=(t "% min read")}}</dd>
				</div>
			</dl>
		</div>
	</div>
</div>
